      "question": "Select the option that is related to the figure in the same way as the second figure is related to the first figure.",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Select the option that is related to the figure in the same way as the second figure is related to the first figure.</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/08/F1_Bubun.R_18-08-21_Savita_D3.png\" style=\"width: 320px; height: 81px;\" /></p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "",
          "html": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/08/F1_Bubun.R_18-08-21_Savita_D4.png\" style=\"width: 79px; height: 69px;\" />"
