      "question": "Select the option that is related to the third figure in the same way as the second figure is related to the first figure.",
      "questionHtml": "<p><span style=\"\">Select the option that is related to the third figure in the same way as the second figure is related to the first figure.</span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/12/F1_Savita_SSC_21.12.2022_D22.png\" style=\"width: 393px; height: 82px;\" /></p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "",
          "html": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/05/F2_Vinanti_SSC_08.05.23_D1_V2.png\" style=\"width: 82px; height: 82px;\" />"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "",
          "html": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/12/F1_Savita_SSC_21.12.2022_D24.png\" style=\"width: 82px; height: 82px;\" />"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "",
          "html": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/12/F1_Savita_SSC_21.12.2022_D25.png\" style=\"width: 81px; height: 82px;\" />"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "",
          "html": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/12/F1_Savita_SSC_21.12.2022_D26.png\" style=\"width: 82px; height: 82px;\" />"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p>The pattern followed here is:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>First rotate the figure 90&ordm; clockwise then mirror image of that figure is the correct answer.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/12/F1_Savita_SSC_21.12.2022_D27.png\" style=\"width: 402px; height: 82px;\" /><br />\nSimilarly,<br />\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/05/F2_Vinanti_SSC_08.05.23_D2_V2.png\" style=\"width: 402px; height: 82px;\" /><br />\nHence, the correct answer is&nbsp;<strong>&quot;Option 1&quot;.</strong></p>\n",
      "images": [
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/12/F1_Savita_SSC_21.12.2022_D22.png",
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/05/F2_Vinanti_SSC_08.05.23_D1_V2.png",
