      "id": "8da31f5cb31d-q3",
      "number": 3,
      "question": "Select the related figure from the given alternatives",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Select the related figure from the given alternatives</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/20/02/F1_A.M_Deepak_29.01.2020_D1.png\" /></p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "",
          "html": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/20/02/F1_A.M_Deepak_29.01.2020_D2.png\" style=\"width: 76px; height: 75px;\" />"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "",
          "html": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/20/02/F1_A.M_Deepak_29.01.2020_D3.png\" style=\"width: 76px; height: 75px;\" />"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "",
          "html": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/20/02/F1_A.M_Deepak_29.01.2020_D4.png\" />"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "",
          "html": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/20/02/F1_A.M_Deepak_29.01.2020_D5.png\" style=\"width: 74px; height: 76px;\" />"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>In the first part of the question, first figure is rotated 90 degrees anticlockwise in order to obtain the second figure.</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/20/02/F1_A.M_Deepak_29.01.2020_D6.png\" style=\"width: 372px; height: 82px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>Hence, figure 3 is the correct answer.</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;\"><img height=\"26px\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/confusion-points-image.png\" width=\"26px\" /><strong><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;\"><u>Confusion Points</u></span></strong></span>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Option figures 2 and 3 are <em><strong>not the same.</strong></em></li>\n\t<li>The difference lies in the types of stars used in the two figures.</li>\n\t<li>The <em><strong>star with 5 corners should be above the star with 4 corners</strong></em>.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n",
      "images": [
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/20/02/F1_A.M_Deepak_29.01.2020_D1.png",
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/20/02/F1_A.M_Deepak_29.01.2020_D2.png",
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/20/02/F1_A.M_Deepak_29.01.2020_D3.png",
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/20/02/F1_A.M_Deepak_29.01.2020_D4.png",
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/20/02/F1_A.M_Deepak_29.01.2020_D5.png",
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/20/02/F1_A.M_Deepak_29.01.2020_D6.png",
        "//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/confusion-points-image.png"
      ],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "8da31f5cb31d-q4",
      "number": 4,
      "question": "Select the related figure from the given alternatives.",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Select the related figure from the given alternatives.</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/03/ai4q.PNG\" style=\"width: 499px; height: 232px;\" /></p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "1",
          "html": "1"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "2",
          "html": "2"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "3",
          "html": "3"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "4",
          "html": "4"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>The logic followed here is:</p>\n\n<p>The figure on the upper right corner comes to the centre with some lines drawn inside it.</p>\n\n<p>The number of lines drawn inside it is&nbsp;determined by the number of sides in the bottom left figure.</p>\n\n<p>Triangle has 3 sides, so, three lines are drawn in the circle.</p>\n\n<p>Similarly, the square has 4 sides so four lines should be drawn inside the pentagon.</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/03/ai4a.PNG\" style=\"width: 499px; height: 104px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>Hence, <strong>option 2</strong> is the correct answer.</p>\n",
      "images": [
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/03/ai4q.PNG",
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/03/ai4a.PNG"
      ],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
